--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: NewTutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb6e8b1fd3dc49f4da0b21f44699aec9, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 2105433060097654824
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 451756015616
    m_Localized: Welcome to the world of Dragon Eclipse!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451785375744
    m_Localized: "Use <color=red>W</color=red>, <color=red>A</color=red>, <color=red>S</color=red>,
      <color=red>D</color=red> keys to move your Tamer along the paths. You can also
      travel by clicking on the path using <color=red>Left Mouse Button</color=red>.\n<br>You
      can interact with different objects by pressing the \u201C<color=red>E</color=red>\u201D
      key or clicking on the object\u2019s name."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451785375745
    m_Localized: Tamer Selection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451785375746
    m_Localized: 'Before you embark on your quest, you need to select a <color=red>Tamer</color=red>
      you will control. Each one has a <color=red>unique ability</color=red>.


      Right
      now you only have access to one. You will unlock the others during your journey!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570048
    m_Localized: Difficulty levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570049
    m_Localized: If you feel confident in your abilities, you may choose a higher
      <color=red>difficulty level</color=red>. At the moment you only have access
      to one, but defeating the boss will unlock the next one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570050
    m_Localized: Mystling Selection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570051
    m_Localized: Your team is made up of 3 Mystlings. Every Mystling has <color=red>unique
      statistics</color=red> and <color=red>Abilities</color=red>. It also adds a
      special <color=red>Card</color=red> to your starting deck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570073
    m_Localized: Progress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570074
    m_Localized: You gain <color=red>Experience Points</color=red> during your adventure.
      When you gain enough, you will level up and unlock new Tamers, Mystlings, Cards
      and more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570077
    m_Localized: The Eclipse is nigh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 451789570078
    m_Localized: Every Battle you fight brings the Eclipse <color=red>one day</color=red>
      closer. When the Timer reaches <color=red>zero</color=red>, the final Battle
      will begin. Spend your remaining days wisely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 13009066783744000
    m_Localized: Test Your Might
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 13009066808909824
    m_Localized: "Looks like the Boss was guarding this <color=red>Eclipse Crystal</color=red>.<br>\nDon't
      worry about defense, it won't bite. Try to deal as much damage to it as possible
      \u2013 you'll only have a couple of Rounds for that. Just give it your best
      shot to dominate the <color=red>Leaderboard</color=red> and prove you're the
      best Tamer that ever was."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752173924352
    m_Localized: Play a <style="Blue">Card</style> on a <style="Blue">Mystling</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895872
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Attacking</style> Mystlings deal Damage equal to their
      <style="Blue">Power</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895873
    m_Localized: Spend 3 <style="Blue">Energy</style> by playing Cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895874
    m_Localized: End your Turn to start the <style="Blue">Creatures' Phase</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895875
    m_Localized: Mystlings in the back <style="Blue">Activate</style>, Mystling in
      the front <style="Blue">Attacks</style>. End your Turn to start the <style="Blue">Creatures'
      Phase</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895876
    m_Localized: Enemies act from <style="Blue">Right</style> to <style="Blue">Left</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895877
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Hover</style> cursor on Enemy's <style="Blue">Intent</style>
      Icon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895878
    m_Localized: Play the <style="Blue">Guard!</style> card on a <style="Blue">Mystling</style>
      to <style="Blue">block</style> incoming Damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895879
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Drag</style> a Mystling to change its position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895880
    m_Localized: Move Mystlings to adapt to the current combat situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895881
    m_Localized: Mystling and enemies can apply <style="Blue">Status</style> effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895882
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Hover</style> cursor on a <style="Blue">Status</style>
      icon (below a Creature) to learn its effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 35532752194895883
    m_Localized: That's the basics! Finish the combat on your own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555785338880
    m_Localized: Each Victory rewards you with some <color=#40E0D0>Mystberries</color=#40E0D0>.
      Use them to acquire <color=#40E0D0>Blessings</color=#40E0D0> and new <color=#40E0D0>Cards</color=#40E0D0>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807872
    m_Localized: Take one card for free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807873
    m_Localized: <color=#40E0D0>Blessings</color=#40E0D0> are similar to Talents.
      They give your Mystlings additional abilities that trigger in certain situations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807874
    m_Localized: Select one of your Mystlings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807875
    m_Localized: Select a Blessing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807876
    m_Localized: Buy a Blessing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807877
    m_Localized: 'A small crowd of people surrounds the Elder. Their raised tone
      indicate that the crowd is concerned. Among other mutter, you can hear the
      Elder''s old shaky voice. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807878
    m_Localized: "We need to stay calm\u2026 I don\u2019t know yet\u2026 I will tell\u2026 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807879
    m_Localized: 'You catch eye contact with him and immediately push through the
      crowd. You speak under your breath. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807880
    m_Localized: "I have some worrying news, Elder. I found old ruins in the forest.
      There was something\u2026 otherworldly. Like a gate to another world. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807881
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s a dire thing to witness! And as you wandered off to
      the forest the Dragon Guardian fell sick. We all feel his blessing weakens! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807882
    m_Localized: "I do not know anything about old ruins and passages to different
      worlds\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807883
    m_Localized: "You need to speak with Ordos the Librarian. Of all the knowledge
      collected, this might be the most useful. I\u2019ll stay here and try to calm
      the people down. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807884
    m_Localized: "Ordos, your former teacher, looks like time has passed him by\u2026
      But his ever patient presence has now become a bundle of nerves. He\u2019s
      frantically looking through his books and scrolls..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807885
    m_Localized: "This cannot be true\u2026 I must check my calculations again..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807886
    m_Localized: "Hello Ordos\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807887
    m_Localized: "\u2026This HAS to be a miscalculation!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807888
    m_Localized: ORDOS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807889
    m_Localized: "(gasps) Don\u2019t you sneak up and scream at me like that!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807890
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m sorry, but I really need to talk to you! I found something
      in the woods\u2026 a portal to another world."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807891
    m_Localized: "\u2026what? How do you know?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807892
    m_Localized: "As you speak of what you saw, Ordos\u2019s eyes widen and his hand
      reaches for a certain book, almost unconsciously leafing through it. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807893
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve been looking into some very old books lately, VERY old
      ones. Speaking of a great cataclysm happening in a distant past."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807894
    m_Localized: Did this catastrophe include the Eclipse in some way? Dual Eclipse,
      of both of our moons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807895
    m_Localized: "Indeed! But how do you know that? I don\u2019t recall you liked
      reading much."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807896
    m_Localized: I think the Dragon Guardian was trying to tell me something...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807897
    m_Localized: "You both come to realization - the Dragon Guardian might not be
      so deep in slumber as it seems\u2026 Maybe it was a way of warning you or begging
      for help?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807898
    m_Localized: "The Eclipse, those portals and monsters\u2026 and if your visions
      were true - you may be of a huge help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807899
    m_Localized: "Me? But how\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807900
    m_Localized: "If I\u2019m not mistaken, there should be a special crystal nearby
      the portal. I think it might be connected to all of this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807901
    m_Localized: "Ordos shoves an open book right into your hands. You see an illustration
      of ruins so similar to the portal, a huge dark crystal behind the entrance\u2026
      and some words of which you can only understand \u201CDragon Guardians\u201D. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807902
    m_Localized: I think the Guardian believes you are worthy. Go to the portal,
      find the crystal and do whatever you can to defeat it. For the sake of all
      of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807903
    m_Localized: The Elder is looking at the sleeping Dragon Guardian with sadness
      in his eyes. Huge dragon seems to struggle to breath, the situtation is getting
      worse every minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807904
    m_Localized: "Oh, it\u2019s you. Any news?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807905
    m_Localized: I met someone, we fought, but he was another Tamer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807906
    m_Localized: "Be careful if you would ever meet him again, it\u2019s a dangerous
      sort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807907
    m_Localized: So you know him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807908
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026we have banished him for an attempt on Guardian\u2019s
      life. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807909
    m_Localized: Why would he do such a thing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807910
    m_Localized: Exactly, why? He was an old student to Ordos, meant to replace the
      old man at some point. Maybe he found something in those books he loved so
      much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807911
    m_Localized: Talk to Ordos, maybe he will know more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807912
    m_Localized: Ordos is lost in thought holding a small, fatigued book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807913
    m_Localized: Ordos, can I ask you a few questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807914
    m_Localized: ..wha? Oh, yes, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807915
    m_Localized: Elder mentioned you used to have an apprentice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807916
    m_Localized: "Sad story, tragic really. He really loved old legends, myths\u2026loved
      them a bit too much."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807917
    m_Localized: What happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807918
    m_Localized: "He was fascinated with the legends of Fey, couldn\u2019t stop talking
      about them. He even looked for their old ruins!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807919
    m_Localized: "That doesn\u2019t sound half bad\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807920
    m_Localized: For a time it was just a childish fascination, but then he changed.
      Started resenting our Guardian, and soon all of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807921
    m_Localized: "When we caught him, he said we was \u201Cbringing justice long
      overdue\u201D. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807922
    m_Localized: And you banished him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807923
    m_Localized: "We did, yes. But why are you asking me this? It\u2019s an old story."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807924
    m_Localized: "I think I met your old student. He\u2019s a Tamer now, but his
      goal seems to remain the same."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807925
    m_Localized: Be careful around him. Fanatics like him are dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807926
    m_Localized: "Tamer! You\u2019re back. Go and see Ordos, he might have a solution
      for this mess!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807927
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m on my way!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807928
    m_Localized: "For once Ordos is not sitting with his nose up a book, but staring
      in the distance. Elder\u2019s moods seems to be contagious."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807929
    m_Localized: Tamer! Good, I know what we should do!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807930
    m_Localized: Oh, do you..?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807931
    m_Localized: YES! Listen, that portal you have found, you must go through it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807932
    m_Localized: "Wait, wait, but that\u2019s where the all monsters come from!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807933
    m_Localized: And most likely where the culprit of our troubles resides!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807934
    m_Localized: "\u2026most likely?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807935
    m_Localized: "\u2026that\u2019s the best I have, I\u2019m afraid\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807936
    m_Localized: "We are running out of opinions Tamer. Dragon Guardian is dying,
      there\u2019s no denying that, and with him gone, we won\u2019t be able to defend
      against those monsters. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807937
    m_Localized: "We have to\u2026YOU have to try, I\u2019m begging you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807938
    m_Localized: "As you said Ordos, we don\u2019t have any other options. Keep your
      fingers crossed that I will come back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807939
    m_Localized: We will all pray for your safe return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807940
    m_Localized: You are met with a village in mourning, something bad must have
      happened while yo were away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807941
    m_Localized: "Arcana? Oh, you\u2019re back! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807942
    m_Localized: What happened here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807943
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s the Guardian\u2026it\u2019s\u2026it\u2019s dead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807944
    m_Localized: But I did defeat that thing! How?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807945
    m_Localized: Nobody knows, Arcana. People are scared, Elder is crestfallen. Is
      there really no hope?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807946
    m_Localized: No!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807947
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807948
    m_Localized: "Enough! I\u2019m going to go back to that shadow land and end it
      for good!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807949
    m_Localized: But, how?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807950
    m_Localized: I have no idea, but Dragon Guardian chose me for a reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807951
    m_Localized: "Arcana\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807952
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t worry, I will end this. Wait for me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807953
    m_Localized: 'You are greeted by your friends, smiles on their faces. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807954
    m_Localized: Did it work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807955
    m_Localized: 'Arcana! Yes! You did it! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807956
    m_Localized: You saved us all Tamer! Good work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807957
    m_Localized: Guardian knew who to choose for the task.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807958
    m_Localized: But the monsters are still out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807959
    m_Localized: Yes, but with such a strong Tamer at our side, I know we can mop
      them out soon enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807960
    m_Localized: So it is over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807961
    m_Localized: "It is a beginning of the end of this cataclysm. But now there\u2019s
      hope. Hope for a future for all of us!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807962
    m_Localized: Yay!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807963
    m_Localized: You journey ends here. You manage to safe your village from the
      Eclipse. It was a struggle, sacrifices were made along the way, but in the
      end, you prevailed. You became a legendary hero, song of your deeds will be
      sang for generations to come. But now you can rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38043555881807964
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m really for what future brings!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368960
    m_Localized: Each Victory rewards you with some <style="Blue">Mystberries</style>.
      Use them to acquire <style="Blue">Blessings</style> and new <style="Blue">Cards</style>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368961
    m_Localized: Take one card for free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368962
    m_Localized: <style="Blue">Blessings</style> are similar to Talents. They give
      your Mystlings additional abilities that trigger in certain situations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368963
    m_Localized: Select one of your Mystlings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368964
    m_Localized: Select a Blessing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288547368965
    m_Localized: Buy a Blessing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502400
    m_Localized: <i>The Elder stands at the Dragon Guardian's altar, leading the
      weekly village meeting.<br><br>The voices of the people gathered sound more
      animated and intense than usual.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502401
    m_Localized: "Uhh, just a moment.<br><br>Yes, Marianne, we are gathering the
      resources to\u2014 No, no, calm down, there's no need to <i>take up arms,</i>
      just\u2014 <br><br><shake>Everyone try to stay calm!</shake><br><font=\"Rounded-Black
      SDF\">Panic will solve nothing.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502402
    m_Localized: <i>You tell the Elder about the strange ruins and the beast you
      fought within their walls.<br><br>You describe how the place felt otherworldly,
      as if linked to something dark and ancient.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502403
    m_Localized: How so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502404
    m_Localized: It seems like some sort of rift has been created, opening a <font="Rounded-Black
      SDF">gateway to the Shadow Realm.</font><br><br>We must hurry and figure out
      how to close it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502405
    m_Localized: Go speak with <font="Rounded-Black SDF">Ordos.</font><br><br>He
      should be more familiar with the matter than I am. Perhaps he can find a solution
      to all this in one of his ancient tomes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502407
    m_Localized: <i>You see a man hunched over a giant locked tome, muttering something
      to himself.<br><br>Ordos, the town's scholar, hobbyist librarian, and your
      former teacher, looks exactly as he did all those years ago. Only a large wrinkle
      on his forehead suggest the passing years of excessive worry.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502408
    m_Localized: <i>He doesn't seem to hear you over his own thoughts and mumblings.</i><br><br><font="vinque-rg
      SDF"><shake a=0.5><size=120%>...et numquam abstergit...</size><size=150%> Deorum
      iram cognoscet!</size></shake></font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502410
    m_Localized: <i>Strange sparks fly around him as he speaks, and the tome flies
      off his lap with supernatural force, still locked shut as if the pages were
      glued together.<br><br>Startled, he jumps up and finally notices you.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502411
    m_Localized: Good to see you too, Ordos. I need to talk to you about something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502412
    m_Localized: <i>As you recount what you saw in the forest, Ordos's eyes widen,
      and the wrinkle on his forehead grows all the more prominent.</i><br><br>Terrible
      news, simply terrible...<br><br><i>He reaches for a heavy tome and starts nervously
      searching through it. Eventually, he turns the book toward you.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502414
    m_Localized: "There are accounts of a great cataclysm, eons ago. Much of the
      tale has been lost to time...<br><br>From what little I've managed to find
      and translate, it was caused by a <font=\"Rounded-Black SDF\">Dual Eclipse</font>
      \u2014 a supernatural event where both our moons eclipsed the sun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502415
    m_Localized: "<i>You recognize the event in the illustration \u2014 it\u2019s
      what you saw in your visions during the earthquake! Could it have been a warning?</i><br><br>What
      do you mean? Where could you have seen it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502416
    m_Localized: <i>Ordos takes a step back, his eyes widening as though they might
      pop out of his skull.</i><br><br>You..? That's <font="Rounded-Black SDF"><bounce>incredible!</bounce></font>
      Oh, we might not be so doomed after all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502417
    m_Localized: What do you mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502418
    m_Localized: It sounds like the Guardian have tried to communicate with you.
      He must have <font="Rounded-Black SDF">chosen you.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 38046161593167872
    m_Localized: So, he chose me... To do what, exactly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502420
    m_Localized: "To save us all from impending doom, I suppose.<br><br>I couldn't
      translate much of the text, but the tale of the Eclipse mentioned a <font=\"Rounded-Black
      SDF\">crystal</font> \u2014 a very powerful one, that is likely to be somewhere
      out there again.<br><br>You must find it and try to destroy it, if that is
      even possible."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502421
    m_Localized: Be brave, Tamer.<br><br>You might just have the fate of the whole
      world on your shoulders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502426
    m_Localized: <i>The Elder is staring at the towering silhouette of the Guardian
      from under his furrowed brows, a serious expression on his face.<br><br>As
      you come closer, you hear the low labored breathing of the sleeping giant.
      Dark spots cover his matted scales.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502427
    m_Localized: "A Tamer you say? <size=75%>Could this be...</size><br><br>This
      may sound pretty far-fetched, but \u2014 did they by any chance have a strange
      cane, capable of summoning <font=\"Rounded-Black SDF\">phantom Mystlings?</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502428
    m_Localized: What happened to him? Did he leave?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502429
    m_Localized: <i>The Elder takes a long pause, his mind briefly travelling back
      to a time decades ago.</i><br><br>He was banished.<br><font="Rounded-Black
      SDF">For an attempt on the Guardian's life.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502435
    m_Localized: <i>Ordos is sitting with his back turned towards you, absorbed in
      the study of a small, worn-out book bound in flaky leather.<br><br><font="vinque-rg
      SDF"><size=120%>...Draco paulo cum adipem culo...</size></font><br><br>Must
      be part of an old prayer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502436
    m_Localized: Hello, Ordos. Can I ask you something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502437
    m_Localized: Ah! You startled me again.<br><br>What is it, young Tamer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502439
    m_Localized: "Oh. That I did. His name was...<br><br>...It doesn't really matter,
      does it? The name I knew him by probably wasn\u2019t even his real one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502441
    m_Localized: ...And he held a deep inexplicable grudge towards <font="Rounded-Black
      SDF">Dragons.</font> Few of us had realized just how deep this hatred actually
      went.<br><br>Ah, but these are all ancient tales. Why are you asking me this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502449
    m_Localized: Tamer! Come quick! <font="Rounded-Black SDF">Ordos</font> might
      have found a solution for all this!<br><br>Go speak to him as soon as you can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502450
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m on my way!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502451
    m_Localized: <i>For the first time in weeks Ordos is not anxiously leafing through
      tomes of forgotten knowledge, deep in contemplation. Instead, he's pacing on
      the ground, no less nervous but also clearly excited.</i><br><br>Tamer! Oh,
      I've been awaiting you. Come, come!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502452
    m_Localized: Remember those portals you found in the ruins? You must try to <font="Rounded-Black
      SDF">enter them.</font><br><br>Yes, I know it might sound crazy and irresponsible,
      but hear me out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502453
    m_Localized: I <font="Rounded-Black SDF">might</font> destroy them? Doesn't sound
      very promising...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502454
    m_Localized: I know, I know, but... that's the best we can do right now, and
      <font="Rounded-Black SDF">we're running out of time.</font><br><br>The Dragon
      Guardian's dying, and the villagers are struggling to defend against the monsters
      as is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502455
    m_Localized: Seems like this is our only option. How can I say no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37705988774502456
    m_Localized: <bounce w=0.7>Thank you,</bounce> Tamer.<br> We are in your debt.<br><br>May
      the Dragons guide your path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563264
    m_Localized: <i>Lyanne jumps into your arms as soon as you enter the village.</i><br><br>Gods,
      you're back! I was so worried!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563265
    m_Localized: <i>She takes a step back and looks down at the ground, her lips
      trembling as if she's on the verge of tears.</i><br><br>The Guardian... <font="Rounded-Black
      SDF">He's dead.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37712648813355008
    m_Localized: "No. There's always hope. This won't be the end \u2014 I'll make
      sure of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563267
    m_Localized: <font="Rounded-Black SDF">How?</font><br><br>How can you fight a
      force powerful enough to kill a Dragon?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37712648834326528
    m_Localized: Don't worry. I'll be back in time for dinner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563277
    m_Localized: Holy scales, you did it!<br><bounce>You actually did it!</bounce><br><br><i>Lyanne
      runs over to you, joy mixed with disbelief on her face.<br><br>Soon, you are
      surrounded by friendly faces, all giddy with excitement, talking over each
      other trying to congratulate you.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37712648834326533
    m_Localized: I only destroyed the source of the Shadows. The monsters are still
      out there...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563279
    m_Localized: Ahh, that is true, but...<br><br>I think we can manage that much.
      Especially with such a skilled Tamer as yourself on our side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563280
    m_Localized: We got surrounded by the little <shake a=0.5>farts</shake> while
      you were gone.<br><br>I'm proud to say I managed to bash one of the freaky
      worms' head in with a chair!<br><br>I might not be a Tamer, but... Well, I
      think I could give you a run for your money. <bounce>Ha!</bounce>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563281
    m_Localized: <i>The Elder clears his throat, slightly awkward.</i><br><br>Ahem...
      Well, Tamer.<br><br>It's great to have you back. You managed to save this little
      village of ours. We are forever in your debt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37712648834326534
    m_Localized: This village is my home. I'm just glad I was able to save it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 37707288551563283
    m_Localized: "<i>The Elder's face lights up with an almost fatherly pride.</i><br><br>Ah...
      The Guardian truly knew who to choose as his prot\xE9g\xE9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 39865059588440064
    m_Localized: Ordos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671578546176
    m_Localized: Elder, may I have a word?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517696
    m_Localized: I found something strange in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517697
    m_Localized: What should I do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517699
    m_Localized: Hello, Ordos. Long time no see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517700
    m_Localized: Wait, I've seen this somewhere before...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517701
    m_Localized: I had a strange vision just before the earthquake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517702
    m_Localized: I'll do my best, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517704
    m_Localized: Oh, hello Tamer. Any news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517705
    m_Localized: I found another set of ruins in the desert. This time, there was
      a Tamer inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517706
    m_Localized: That's exactly them! Do you know who it was?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517707
    m_Localized: I had the misfortune of knowing him, yes.<br><br>He used to be Ordos's
      apprentice, back when I first became the village's Elder. A very bright fellow,
      but there had always been this... fire in his eyes that honestly scared me,
      even back then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517708
    m_Localized: Oh Gods. Why would he do such a thing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517709
    m_Localized: Hard to tell. He never seemed quite... right in the head.<br><br>If
      you want to know more about him, <font="Rounded-Black SDF">ask Ordos</font>.
      The two had shared a study, as well as a passion for knowledge for many years,
      after all. If anyone will know anything, it's him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517710
    m_Localized: I heard you had an apprentice who was banished from the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517712
    m_Localized: He was very secretive, fascinated by old myths and legends to the
      point of obsession.<br><br>He scoured ancient historical tomes looking for
      proof of the existence of Fey, searched through hundreds of maps in looking
      for their ruins...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517713
    m_Localized: I think I've met this student of yours. He seemed to be using some
      kind of Shadow magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517714
    m_Localized: <i>Ordos looks up at you and you sense a profound sadness hidden
      just under the surface, the kind you've never seen in him before.</i><br><br>Is
      that so? That's... Quite unfortunate to hear. Seems like he hasn't changed
      much in all those years...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517716
    m_Localized: Uh-uh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517717
    m_Localized: Destroy it and <font="Rounded-Black SDF">you might just destroy
      the source of the Shadow forces</font> that have been plaguing our village!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517718
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517719
    m_Localized: Please... You're the only one who stands any chance in this battle.
      I know it's a lot to ask, but...<br><br>The whole village is counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517720
    m_Localized: Worried? Why? What happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517721
    m_Localized: "What? How? I\u2014I don't understand..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517722
    m_Localized: "The disease... The black spots... It finally took him. Seems even
      Gods aren't invincible against the Eclipse's power.<br><br>...Is\u2014 Is this
      the end? Is there really no hope for us?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517723
    m_Localized: Simple. With sheer stubbornness and no sense of self-preservation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517724
    m_Localized: ...You never cease to amaze me, you know that?<br><br><i>She steps
      closer and pulls you into a tight hug. You feel a tear fall onto your shoulder.</i><br><br>Just
      please... don't get yourself hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517725
    m_Localized: Did it work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517726
    m_Localized: That it did.<br><br>We might just owe you our lives, Tamer. Or at
      the very least, our home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517728
    m_Localized: Oh for sure. You'd definitely be the <font="Rounded-Black SDF">scariest</font>
      Tamer out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517730
    m_Localized: "I wish I could properly repay you for all your hard work, but we
      aren't exactly in the most prosperous of times...<br><br>After the earthquake
      and all the destruction\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42406671599517731
    m_Localized: "<i>Your journey ends here. You managed to save the village and
      stop the coming Eclipse, proving yourself as a great Tamer \u2014 perhaps the
      best this village has ever seen.<br>Tales of your heroic deeds will be sung
      for centuries. Maybe even Ordos will immortalize your story in one of his tomes
      if you ask nicely.<br><br>As one chapter of your adventure comes to an end,
      another one begins. What new stories will fate weave for you? One thing is
      certain \u2014 where once was despair and fear, now shines hope.</i><br><br>Great
      job and thank you for playing!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42410027705417728
    m_Localized: Let's see what the future brings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42415937366507520
    m_Localized: <font="vinque-rg SDF"><size=120%><shake a=0.5>Nam qui cagat...</shake></size></font><br><br>No,
      that's not right...<br><br><font="vinque-rg SDF"><size=120%><shake a=0.5>Nam
      qui cacat...</shake></size></font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42415937366507521
    m_Localized: Ah! It's you!<br>Good to see you, good to see you!<br><br>How long
      have you been standing there? You should have come over and said hello!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42415937366507522
    m_Localized: "Centuries ago, there were legends of the <font=\"Rounded-Black
      SDF\">Draconic Chosen</font> \u2014 Tamers who had been blessed by a Guardian,
      imbued with their power and guidance.<br><br>It seems our Guardian might not
      have been as deeply asleep as we thought... And he found you worthy to share
      a portion of his power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42416728437407744
    m_Localized: "The monsters you fought at the ruins travel through the portals,
      but they don't <font=\"Rounded-Black SDF\">open</font> them.<br><br>Their source
      must be on the other side \u2014 possibly a crystal commanding all the other
      crystals you've been seeing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42424946089771008
    m_Localized: Now, excuse me.<br><br><i>The Elder pushes through the people to
      talk to you away from the agitated crowd.</i><br><br>What is it, young Tamer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42424946089771009
    m_Localized: Ah... I can't say I'm surprised. This is what I feared from the
      beginning.<br><br>Your journey may be about to become a lot more difficult
      and treacherous than we had expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42424946089771010
    m_Localized: <font="Rounded-Black SDF">The Guardian...</font><br><br>I can feel
      him growing weaker, as though he's being corrupted by the Shadows.<br><br>I
      haven't told the townsfolk yet, but I think they can sense it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42424946089771011
    m_Localized: I'll stay here and try to calm the people down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 42438740392263680
    m_Localized: He came to our village as a young man, saying he wanted to peruse
      my library in exchange for helping me with my research.<br><br>He was... very
      charming, and after receiving a few compliments I relented and took him in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391828
    m_Localized: Mystling Egg
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391829
    m_Localized: Looks like you unlocked a Mystling Egg! Hatch it and access it when
      you start a <color=red>new Run</color=red>. Collect them all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391831
    m_Localized: The Elder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391832
    m_Localized: Lyanne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391834
    m_Localized: "...I\u2019m just so proud of you, you know? You\u2019ve worked
      so hard for this, and now you\u2019ll get to be a real Tamer, and\u2013"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391835
    m_Localized: Lyn. <i><b>Lyn.</i></b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391836
    m_Localized: Huh? What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391837
    m_Localized: "...I think we\u2019re lost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391838
    m_Localized: "<wiggle>WHAA\u2013?!</wiggle> Girl, shouldn\u2019t you be, like,
      trained in this stuff?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391839
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m a <i>Tamer</i>, not a cartographer..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391840
    m_Localized: <shake>AAH!</shake> What is that <i><b>thing</i></b>?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391841
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t worry, I got this! <b><br><size=16><align=left><smallcaps>Play
      the tutorial</smallcaps></align></size></b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391842
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s a monster! Run Lyn, RUN! <b><br><size=16><align=left><smallcaps>Skip
      the tutorial</smallcaps></align></size></b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391843
    m_Localized: Phew... THAT was close! Now, let's find our way back to town before
      the ceremony ends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391844
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391845
    m_Localized: That was... So. Very. Cool. You and your Mysts make an awesome team.
      Now, shall we go? Your ceremony's waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391846
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391847
    m_Localized: What are you waiting for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391848
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s time to go!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391849
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s your big day, why are you still here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391850
    m_Localized: "They\u2019ll eat all the food before us... hurry!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391851
    m_Localized: "If you don\u2019t hurry up, they might choose someone else for
      a Tamer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391852
    m_Localized: If you need something for the road the Village Chef will fix you
      a snack, free of charge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391853
    m_Localized: Ah, here you are. Come closer, child.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391854
    m_Localized: <i>Approach</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391855
    m_Localized: We have gathered here today to welcome a new face into the ranks
      of our Tamers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391856
    m_Localized: Young Tamer... May the Earth Guardian lead your way. <br><br><i>He
      gestures for you to come closer.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391857
    m_Localized: <i>Approach</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391858
    m_Localized: "<i>The majestic giant towers above you. <br><br>He\u2019s been
      sleeping here for centuries, silently guarding the town and watching over its
      people.</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391859
    m_Localized: <i>Touch the Dragon</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391860
    m_Localized: "<i>You touch the tip of the Dragon Guardian\u2019s nose as is tradition
      for every new Tamer. <br><br>As soon as you do, you feel the earth under your
      feet tremble and your vision blurs...</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391861
    m_Localized: You approach the towering figure to touch the very tip of his nose,
      as is customary for every new Tamer. The scales seem to shine from weary, but
      not all that touched him had become Tamers... You ponder on it for a while.
      Suddenly, your mind is struck and flooded by unsettling visions!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391862
    m_Localized: <i>Your mind is flooded by strange visions - a dark sun, eclipsed
      by the two moons...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391863
    m_Localized: <i>Shadowy figures emerging from a portal deep in a forest, <b>your
      forest</b>, the one just outside the town...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391864
    m_Localized: <i>And a gentle but firm voice resonating in your head:</i><br><br>
      "<font="Rounded-Black SDF">We need you... Your help... Find a way...</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391865
    m_Localized: Is everything alright?<br><br><i>You feel the worried eyes of the
      townsfolk on you as you slowly return to your senses. You must have passed
      out during the ceremony.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391866
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m fine, I think..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391867
    m_Localized: Are you alright, child? You collapsed and we were worried about
      you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391868
    m_Localized: "Uh, I\u2019m fine... I guess. I saw... "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391869
    m_Localized: "<i>As you scramble to your feet you feel the earth quake again.
      This time, <shake>it\u2019s not a vision!</shake> <br><br>Panic breaks out
      among the gathered as walls crack and the sky darkens.</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391870
    m_Localized: "What was that? What\u2019s happening?! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391871
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s happening... Oh, Dragon Guardians save us..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391872
    m_Localized: "What was that? What\u2019s going on?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391873
    m_Localized: Listen very carefully, Tamer. I need you to head to the forest and
      look for any signs of destruction outside of town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391874
    m_Localized: You got it, boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391875
    m_Localized: "Report back to me as soon as you find anything. <br><br>Let\u2019s
      hope it isn\u2019t too late..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391876
    m_Localized: <i>Leave</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391877
    m_Localized: "You know the path, but you don\u2019t know the ending. Be brave."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391878
    m_Localized: Take care and take courage with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391879
    m_Localized: 'We all hope to see you soon... with some consoling news. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391880
    m_Localized: "Did you remember to feed your mystlings well? There\u2019s a long
      walk ahead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391881
    m_Localized: "Remember, it\u2019s not about never falling, but rising every time
      after that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391882
    m_Localized: "I should say something wise... but it\u2019s time to go now. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391883
    m_Localized: Phew... Glad we managed to make it to your ceremony. <br>A fully
      fledged Tamer, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391884
    m_Localized: Yup, that's me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391885
    m_Localized: Hey, I think some Mystlings have followed us home from the forest!
      The poor buggers seem so scared... <br><br>Man, <wave>we gotta help them out!</wave>
      Wanna adopt one of them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391886
    m_Localized: Sure! Come here, little guy - you'll be safe with me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391887
    m_Localized: Aww, look at you two! You look <bounce>so cute</bounce> together.
      <br><br>I know you'll take good care of them, mama bear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391888
    m_Localized: ...And here I go getting distracted again. <br><br>I was meant to
      tell you that <font="Rounded-Black SDF">the Elder is waiting for you by the
      Guardian!</font> He looked rather serious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391913
    m_Localized: New Tamer unlocked!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45300613990391914
    m_Localized: A new Tamer has joined our cause! Just start a <color=red>new Run</color=red>
      and select her as your playable character to access her <color=red>unique ability</color=red>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514947
    m_Localized: To become a true Tamer you must master the <bounce>bond</bounce>
      with your Mystlings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514948
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s go back to the <wave>basics</wave> and refresh your
      memory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514959
    m_Localized: <bounce>Great job!</bounce> You're extremely talented, but I think
      that extra <wave>help</wave> won't hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514960
    m_Localized: Take one with you! A final gift from me to our fearless <bounce>Tamer.</bounce>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514961
    m_Localized: 'The world is going mad outside our Village!

      The upcoming
      <shake>Eclipse</shake> is blurring the border between our World and the Dark
      Plane.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514962
    m_Localized: <wiggle>Evil creatures</wiggle> invade our world through Dark Portals.
      You have to stop them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514963
    m_Localized: Use the knowledge you gained to stop the <shake>Eclipse!</shake>
      You are our only <bounce>hope!</bounce>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  - m_Id: 45304894210514966
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations, Tamer!

      <br>

      You defeated the Boss,
      but the danger is not over yet! We hope you will challenge your skills and
      beat other difficulty levels too.

      There is still more content waiting
      for you to unlock. On top of that, we are planning to add a lot of new challenges
      and extra content in the upcoming updates.

      <br>

      We sincerely
      hope you enjoyed your time with Dragon Eclipse. If you did, spreading a word
      about the game or leaving a Steam review would go a long way.

      <br>

      Thank
      you!

      Fardust Team'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654824
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
